{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is approached, grab it, move it, check properties, do task. Else, approach object, scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDesignatedArea    /> <Action ID = ScanObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsDesignatedAreaReached    /> <Condition ID = isObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    />",
